# Task 8 — Capture Network Traffic with Wireshark

## Installation
Wireshark was already available on the Kali Linux VM used for this internship. To avoid needing `sudo` for every capture, I added my account to the `wireshark` group:

```bash
sudo usermod -aG wireshark $USER

After logging out and back in (or restarting the VM), I confirmed the change with:
Bash
groups

